About Main2.java

Imagine 100 Animal Types

Without polymorphism


playDogSound(Dog dog)
playCatSound(Cat cat)
playLionSound(Lion lion)
playTigerSound(Tiger tiger)
playCowSound(Cow cow)
playGoatSound(Goat goat)
...

100 methods.

With polymorphism

Only one method

public static void playSound(Animal animal){

    animal.sound();

}

Works for

Dog
Cat
Lion
Tiger


....

No changes.